 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dSNjmR1zV1UQ7kNvwF-P8Re&_nc_oc=AdpbsQy2eWhBvAEyWhG81Qk2HeXiKjNQALQf3dKc_MWdf2a39tu4ViXwealTaICb0IQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLSfbu4h-aky1pIJswFyDQOOFEsSPLSpZAM71fLTqH-6w&oe=6AB29C41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JfoDmKLT544Q7kNvwGPpZS6&_nc_oc=AdrTWeVN5aqrGQCYfNNnMG9noLAN3697EyZkbDp1tCAz9I9nDpvMZS5U7k-9yRVDy_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJKsbAns_cZtk4E8Rg0pBSYd5kqRx8bIxHWHDpYEABbFg&oe=6AB27166"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A-MnbxfVzEwQ7kNvwFH8bd6&_nc_oc=AdoT1K8qyzZw5BpDqo7oXayAKHSwrVPARgTcdyk_ZVm2Cz7btHX12mW7kJhx6eIWaQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQInbDDBazpq0vnWTlvC4UI_ff9hlQyYRP6edvuu6BXwrg&oe=6AB27B5C"}, {"fil